      ],
      "title": "围追堵截·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "31017001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "这里就是|101|的家？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31017002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "嗯，不过好像有点情况……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31017003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "怎么办怎么办！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31017004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "好可怕……主人救我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31017005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "冷静点啊，花花花花迦！绝对不能让恐怖分子伤害主人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31017006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "趁着主人还没回来，我们……一定要把危险驱逐出去！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31018001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "发生什么事了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31018002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "家里有变态！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31018003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "变态？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31018004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "不要凑那么近啊！会有危险的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31018005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "说！告诉我！东西——都藏在哪了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31018006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "闹斯尼",
          "text": "救命！唔！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31018007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "不说？很好，看来你是想让我帮你——这个裁纸刀不错，你想来试试吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31018008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "听见了吗？是不是很恐怖！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31018009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "声音好大，闯进屋子里的不会是……人类吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31018010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "人类？可我们只是手办……可是，主人马上就要回来了。\n如果我们还不能把坏人赶跑，万一主人受到了伤害……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31018011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "即使在人类面前暴露身份，我也要守护主人的安全！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31018012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "等一下，我好像听见了什么声音……唔……好像是开锁的声音？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31018013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我回来了，嗯？你是——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31018014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "主人！等一下——别进去！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31018015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我不管了！我要去保护主人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31018016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "等等我们，不要单独行动啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-670",
